July 2026 Politburo meeting; Fifth Plenum set for October; Signals of marginal, incremental policy support. The Politburo held its July meeting today. Some of the highlights:





Fifth Plenum scheduled for October, agenda is “to study major issues concerning the unremitting advancement of full and rigorous Party self-governance”;



